<title>INDIA: SSKI Securities Indian stock recommendations.</title>
<headline>SSKI Securities Indian stock recommendations.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian securities firm SSKI Securities have analysed the short-term expected performances of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index companies.</p>
<p>The stocks have been given &quot;outperformer,&quot; &quot;underperformer&quot; or &quot;neutral&quot; ranks based on SSKI's view on the stock's price performance vis-a-vis the BSE sensitive index over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;The long-term recommendation takes a one to three year view and is more linked to the company's fundamentals - it will be either &quot;buy&quot; or &quot;sell,&quot; Amit Mukherjee of SSKI's research unit said.</p>
<p>				    'Recommendations'</p>
<p>Name of Companies	Short term	  Long term</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>ACC	     Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Arvind Mills Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Bajaj Auto   Outperformer	Buy</p>
<p>BHEL	   Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>GE Shipping  Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Grasim	 Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Guj Ambuja   Outperformer	Buy</p>
<p>Hindalco     Underperformer    Buy</p>
<p>Hin Lever     Neutral	     Sell</p>
<p>HPCL	   Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>ICICI	  Outperformer	Buy</p>
<p>IDBI	   Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Ind Hotels   Outperformer	Buy</p>
<p>IPCL	   Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>ITC	     Outperformer	Buy</p>
<p>L &amp; T	  Outperformer	Buy</p>
<p>M &amp; M	  Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>MTNL	   Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Ranbaxy	Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>Reliance     Underperformer    Buy</p>
<p>SAIL	   Underperformer    Sell</p>
<p>SBI	     Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>TELCO	  Neutral	     Buy</p>
<p>TISCO	  Neutral	     Sell</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
